ThreeFExecuting
├── guarded mint
│   ├── requires account as policy consumer
│   ├── binds principal and yield to the guarded leaf
│   └── preserves direct guarded account management
├── direct mint
│   ├── requires executor as policy consumer and no installed capability
│   ├── uses committed Call data for policy consumption
│   ├── binds native mint amounts to live authorization
│   ├── checks request factory membership
│   ├── checks exact cash debit and principal/yield increases
│   ├── rejects a no-op mint without consuming budget
│   └── rolls back the policy charge on failed mint or later approval cleanup
└── both modes
    ├── fund from idle assets and ordered sources without spending adapter reserves
    ├── reject stale authorization, wrong funding deltas, insufficient budget and low yield
    ├── pin native or nested request target and enforce proof and leaf role
    ├── clear approval after minting
    └── consumer changes preserve usage and immediately block the old mode
